<h1>Is GBA Emulator Legal? Is EggerMath Safe?</h1>
<h2>Emulator = Legal, ROM = Own Your Game</h2><p>Emulators like mGBA are legal (like a media player). Downloading ROMs you don't own may violate copyright. Use your own dumps or public domain ROMs.</p>
<h2>Is EggerMath Safe?</h2><p>Yes — runs entirely in your browser via WebAssembly, no executable download. Saves stay in your browser storage. See <a href="/pages/privacy">Privacy</a> and <a href="/pages/takedown">DMCA</a>.</p>
